{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>天文台於今日（11月24日）11:30發出特別天氣提示，指出受東北季候風影響，未來一兩日（11月25及26日）本港早晚將會清涼，市民應注意保暖，特別是長者及小童，需防止因氣溫下降而引發的健康問題。\n</p>\n<p>此外，由於天文大潮及東北季候風的共同影響，預料本港明日（11月25日）晚上沿岸水位將較正常稍高，部分低窪地區可能出現輕微水浸。居住於低窪地區的市民應提前做好防洪準備，確保排水系統暢通，並將貴重物品移至高處。</p>\n<p>天文台提醒市民密切留意最新天氣資訊，並採取適當措施以應對可能的天氣變化。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b8%85%e6%b6%bc%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">清涼天氣</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 24 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T04:23:56.523039+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":277,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T04:15:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T05:57:23.258026+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T04:17:26.632714+00:00","content_hash":"41e44e1d5ddb5bda5f24d4c1519df2569524e178f68bf7f2f72e752a709e29d8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}